 "solution": "\\(a_1=1\\)，\\(a_2=1+2\\)，\\(a_3=1+2+3\\)，\\(a_4=1+2+3+4\\)，…，所以\\(a_n=1+2+\\cdots+n=\\dfrac{n(n+1)}2\\)。\n\\(\\dfrac1{a_n}=\\dfrac2{n(n+1)}=2\\left(\\dfrac1n-\\dfrac1{n+1}\\right)\\)。\n原式\\(=2\\left(1-\\dfrac12+\\dfrac12-\\dfrac13+\\cdots+\\dfrac1n-\\dfrac1{n+1}\\right)=2\\left(1-\\dfrac1{n+1}\\right)=\\dfrac{2n}{n+1}\\)。",
